  "title": "Evil in Waiting",
  "description": "A ghost named Valdar guards the tomb of the Dragon Priest Hevnoraak in Valthume. With his strength fading, he needs a champion to collect three vessels containing Hevnoraak's blood, perform a ritual to weaken the priest, and defeat him before he resurrects.",
  "npc_facts": {
    "Valdar": {
      "base_facts": [
        "I am Valdar, a ghost bound to guard the tomb of Hevnoraak in Valthume.",
        "Hevnoraak was a Dragon Priest who enthralled his followers and planned his resurrection obsessively before dying.",
        "My duty in life and in death is to ensure Hevnoraak stays in his tomb for eternity.",
        "My strength is fading. I need a champion to collect three vessels to help vanquish Hevnoraak."
      ],
      "beat_facts": {
        "ACCEPT_CHALLENGE": [
          "A champion has agreed to help me collect the vessels and defeat Hevnoraak."
        ],
        "VESSELS_COLLECTED": [
          "The champion has returned with all three vessels containing Hevnoraak's blood."
        ],
        "RITUAL_COMPLETE": [
          "The ritual is done. Hevnoraak is awakened but weakened. He must be destroyed now."
        ],
        "QUEST_COMPLETE": [
          "Hevnoraak is defeated at last. My eternal vigil is over. I can finally rest.",
          "Hevnoraak is defeated. Valdar thanks the player and fades away, quest complete.",
          "Return to the two-leveled chamber and locate the eastern door, leading to the next zone, Valthume Catacombs.",
          "Evil stirs in this place.\" The Nordic ruin of Valthume lies southeast of Markarth at the end of the path that leads southeast from Dushnikh Yal ."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
